<view class="page"><view class="hero"><view class="title">交接确认</view><view class="subtitle">双方可在同一台手机上填写并签署。</view></view><view class="card"><view class="grid"><view><view class="label">租客姓名 *</view><input class="input" data-k="tenantName" value="{{c.tenantName}}" bindinput="set"/></view><view><view class="label">房东/中介姓名 *</view><input class="input" data-k="landlordName" value="{{c.landlordName}}" bindinput="set"/></view><view><view class="label">租客联系方式</view><input class="input" data-k="tenantContact" value="{{c.tenantContact}}" bindinput="set"/></view><view><view class="label">房东/中介联系方式</view><input class="input" data-k="landlordContact" value="{{c.landlordContact}}" bindinput="set"/></view></view><view class="label">交接日期 *</view><picker mode="date" data-k="date" value="{{c.date}}" bindchange="set"><view class="picker">{{c.date||'选择日期'}}</view></picker><view class="label">双方补充说明</view><textarea class="textarea" data-k="note" value="{{c.note}}" bindinput="set"/></view><view class="card"><view class="card-title">手写签名</view><view class="grid"><view><view class="muted">租客签名</view><image wx:if="{{c.tenantSignature}}" class="signature" src="{{c.tenantSignature}}" mode="aspectFit"/><button class="btn secondary small" data-who="tenant" bindtap="startSign">{{c.tenantSignature?'重新签署':'开始签署'}}</button></view><view><view class="muted">房东/中介签名</view><image wx:if="{{c.landlordSignature}}" class="signature" src="{{c.landlordSignature}}" mode="aspectFit"/><button class="btn secondary small" data-who="landlord" bindtap="startSign">{{c.landlordSignature?'重新签署':'开始签署'}}</button></view></view><view class="notice">签名仅用于记录双方当时的确认情况，本工具不对其法律效力作出保证。</view></view><button class="btn" bindtap="save">保存交接确认</button><app-disclaimer/>
<view class="mask" wx:if="{{signing}}"><view class="sign-box"><view class="between"><view class="card-title">请在下方签名</view><text bindtap="cancel">关闭</text></view><canvas canvas-id="signCanvas" class="canvas" disable-scroll="true" bindtouchstart="touchStart" bindtouchmove="touchMove" bindtouchend="touchEnd"></canvas><view class="between"><button class="btn secondary small" bindtap="clear">清除</button><button class="btn small" bindtap="finish">保存签名</button></view></view></view></view>
